                                "sense_id": "7674c59d-b31c-3b52-83ac-fb1b31aed6d6",
                                "text": "For the busy traffic's roar, and the fogdom dun and brown\nOf thy streets, O London Town!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad56a254-97a7-48c1-9a6e-3e76247f99cd",
                                "sense_id": "7674c59d-b31c-3b52-83ac-fb1b31aed6d6",
                                "text": "After about two more weeks of fogdom, she wanted to rent a few movies."
